## what is a system prompt ?

A system prompt is a set of instructions that tells the AI.
It gives the direction. It controls behaviour of the answer.

Good prompts are specific. clearer th instructions better the results.

Who are you?
How should you behave?
What tone should you use?
what should you avoid?
who is your audience?

Unlike user messages, the system prompt is not part of the conversation.
Instead it acts like a set of permanent instructions that guides every response.

Think of it as AI's job description

## Example : 

Imagine you have hired a new customer support executive.
On the first day, you dont simply say:
"Answer customer questions"

You also give instructions such as :
Be polite
Dont argue with customers
Use simple language
If you dont know the answer, admit it honestly

Based on the different situations we can choose how our AI model should behave.

We are not building new projects everyday. We are continously improving the same assistant.
Thats exaclty how the software evolves.

Day3 is about Multi role AI assistant

